    "Weather data is provided by Open-Meteo.com under the CC BY 4.0 license. The app is open source and licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later." : {
      "comment" : "About section legal text describing licenses for the data and the app",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بيانات الطقس مقدمة من Open-Meteo.com بموجب ترخيص CC BY 4.0. التطبيق مفتوح المصدر ومرخص بموجب GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Wetterdaten werden von Open-Meteo.com unter der CC-BY-4.0-Lizenz bereitgestellt. Die App ist Open Source und steht unter der Lizenz GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weather data is provided by Open-Meteo.com under the CC BY 4.0 license. The app is open source and licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los datos meteorológicos son proporcionados por Open-Meteo.com bajo la licencia CC BY 4.0. La app es de código abierto y se distribuye con la licencia GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les données météo sont fournies par Open-Meteo.com sous licence CC BY 4.0. L'app est open source et distribuée sous licence GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "मौसम डेटा Open-Meteo.com द्वारा CC BY 4.0 लाइसेंस के अंतर्गत प्रदान किया जाता है। यह ऐप ओपन सोर्स है और GPL-2.0-or-later के अंतर्गत लाइसेंस प्राप्त है।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Data cuaca disediakan oleh Open-Meteo.com di bawah lisensi CC BY 4.0. Aplikasi ini bersifat sumber terbuka dan dilisensikan di bawah GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I dati meteo sono forniti da Open-Meteo.com con licenza CC BY 4.0. L'app è open source e distribuita con licenza GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "天気データは Open-Meteo.com から CC BY 4.0 ライセンスのもとで提供されています。本アプリはオープンソースで、GPL-2.0-or-later のもとでライセンスされています。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "날씨 데이터는 CC BY 4.0 라이선스에 따라 Open-Meteo.com에서 제공합니다. 이 앱은 오픈 소스이며 GPL-2.0-or-later 라이선스로 배포됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Os dados meteorológicos são fornecidos pela Open-Meteo.com sob a licença CC BY 4.0. O app é de código aberto e licenciado sob GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Данные о погоде предоставлены Open-Meteo.com по лицензии CC BY 4.0. Приложение с открытым исходным кодом и распространяется по лицензии GPL-2.0-or-later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
